Resilience vs Reliability
Term	Meaning
Reliability	System works correctly under normal conditions
Resilience	System recovers quickly from failures

👉 A reliable system can still fail badly if it’s not resilient.


We achieved high availability by running multiple replicas across availability zones, using load balancers and Kubernetes health checks. Failed pods were automatically replaced without customer impact.



High Availability (HA)
Definition

