What is Error Budget?

The amount of failure you are allowed.

Example

SLO = 99.9% uptime/month

Allowed downtime ≈ 43 minutes/month

That 43 minutes = error budget

Why It’s Useful

Encourages safe releases

Balances speed vs stability




